["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">培</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>培养；培育</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つちか.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">栽培</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">栽培；种植；培养</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">艇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>小船；划艇</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">屈</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>弯曲；屈服；退缩；弯腰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">クツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かが.む・かが.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">退屈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいくつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">乏味；无聊；沉闷；单调；令人厌烦；感到厌倦；厌烦；厌倦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">窮屈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうくつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">狭窄；紧绷；局促；正式；拘谨；严格；刻板；死板；受拘束；不自在；局促不安；紧张；吃紧（如财务状况）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">屈折</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くっせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弯曲；曲折；扭转；蜿蜒；扭曲；歪曲；变形；折射；词形变化；屈折变化</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">径</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>直径；小路；方法；直接</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みち・こみち・さしわたし・ただちに</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">直径</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょっけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">直径</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">半径</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">半径</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">淡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>淡薄；浅淡；微弱；短暂</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あわ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">淡水</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">淡水；不含盐分的水</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷淡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいたん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷漠；漠不关心；冷淡；冷酷；无情；不友善；冷心肠</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">抽</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>抽取；拔出；抽出；卓越</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひき-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">抽象</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抽象；抽象化</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">抽選</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抽签；摇奖；抽奖</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">披</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>暴露；打开</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">廷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>朝廷；宫廷；法庭；官署</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">法廷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">法庭；法院</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">錦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>锦缎；华服；荣誉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">にしき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">准</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>准；准同；副</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">暑</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>炎热；暑热；夏季的酷热</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あつ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暑い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">炎热；闷热；酷热；热情的；激情的；炽热的（欲望等）；引人关注的；时下热门的；备受瞩目的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">蒸し暑い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むしあつい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">闷热；湿热</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">磯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>海滨；海岸</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いそ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">奨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>劝勉；鼓励；激励</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ・ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すす.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">奨学金</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうがくきん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奖学金；助学金；津贴；补助金；助学贷款</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">奨励</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうれい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">鼓励；提倡；奖励；促进</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">浸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>浸湿；浸泡；浸透；蘸；浸染</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひた.す・ひた.る・つ.かる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浸ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">浸泡；浸渍；蘸；浸入；腌制；腌渍；用盐或醋等腌渍</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">浸す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひたす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">浸泡；浸渍；浸没；润湿；打湿</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">剰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>剩余；另外；多余</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あまつさえ・あま.り・あま.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">過剰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">过剩；过多；过量；盈余</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">胆</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>胆囊；胆量；勇气</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きも</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大胆</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だいたん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大胆；勇敢；果敢</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">繊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>纤细；精细；薄绢</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">化繊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">合成纤维；化学纤维</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">繊維</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纤维</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">駒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>棋子；马驹；琴码（弦乐器）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">虚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>空虚；空洞；虚伪；裂缝；毫无准备</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ・コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むな.しい・うつ.ろ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">謙虚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんきょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谦虚；谦逊；虚心</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">霊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>灵魂；精灵；神灵</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レイ・リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\