class=\"k-wz\">翻译；译文；破译；解码；（生物）翻译（依据信使核糖核酸合成蛋白质）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">墜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>坠落；掉落</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ツイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.ちる・お.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">墜落</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ついらく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">坠落；（飞机等）失事</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">沼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>沼泽；池塘；湿地</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沼泽；湿地；泥沼；池塘；痴迷；沉溺；上瘾；丑男；相貌丑陋的男人；智障；精神残疾人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">据</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>设置；安装；坐下；蹲下；奠定基础</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.える・す.わる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">据える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">放置；固定；安设（如桌子）；奠基；安置；使就座；确定；凝定（如目光）；施灸；行艾灸</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">据え付ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すえつける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安装；装配；固定；设置<